PN,41106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786465168
OL,3,CMoon to cover 90% of sun in 'deepest
OL,4,Ceclipse until 2090'
OL,6,F"Sunlight contains strong and harmful
OL,7,Fultraviolet (UV) light which will
OL,8,Fdamage your eyes. Use eclipse glasses,
OL,9,Fsolar filters or make a pinhole
OL,10,Fprojector using a cardboard box, tin
OL,11,Ffoil and white paper."
